story='''<section class="editorial-hero"><div class="editorial-image"><img src="assets/beekeeper-owner.webp" alt="Creative-concept beekeeper portrait"></div><div class="editorial-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A STORY OF ROOTS & BLOOMS</p><h1>A little bit of Ukraine.<br><em>A whole lot of heart.</em></h1><p>A beekeeper’s heritage. A family making a home in the Carolinas. A love for the remarkable little world inside every hive.</p></div></section><section class="section-padding"><div class="container editorial-body"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">MEET FLOURISH</p><h2>Made by people.<br><em>Made with care.</em></h2></div><div><p>Flourish Bee Farm brings together a Ukrainian beekeeper’s knowledge, Carolina landscapes and a family story worth sharing.</p><p>We want customers to feel that connection: to see the person behind the jar, learn about seasonal honey and find something special among the hive’s many creations.</p><p class="editorial-footnote">This draft is based on the owner details shared with Brand Axis. The beekeeper's full biography, photographs and production practices will be added with his approval.</p><a href="why-flourish.html" class="underlined-link">Discover what makes us Flourish <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="story-photo-row"><img src="assets/market-stand.webp" alt="Real Flourish Bee Farm vendor table with honey and honeycomb" loading="lazy"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">BEHIND THE MARKET TABLE</p><h2>Already made.<br><em>Ready to share.</em></h2><p>Our collection comes from products already presented to customers at events—honey, honeycomb, candles and more. The next step is helping people shop beyond the market table.</p><a href="shop.html" class="btn btn-dark">Shop the collection ↗</a></div></section>'''
page('our-story.html','Our Story',story)
why='''<section class="page-hero why-hero"><div class="page-hero-copy container"><p class="eyebrow warm">WHY FLOURISH</p><h1>I know the trees.<br><em>I know the bees.</em></h1><p>When you know where something comes from, every little detail means more.</p></div><div class="page-hero-img"><img src="assets/hero.webp" alt="Concept nature and beekeeping photography"></div></section><section class="section-padding"><div class="container value-story"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">01 · THE LANDSCAPE</p><h2>It starts<br><em>with a bloom.</em></h2><p>Different plants bloom at different times, and nectar sources help shape a honey's character. Our job is to tell customers what makes each Flourish harvest distinct, using the beekeeper’s verified descriptions.</p></div><img loading="lazy" src="assets/harvest.webp" alt="Concept image showing a beautiful honey harvest"></div></section><section class="section-padding alternate-section"><div class="container value-story reverse"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">02 · THE PERSON</p><h2>The beekeeper<br><em>behind the jar.</em></h2><p>The Ukrainian-American family identity gives Flourish a story competitors cannot imitate. We'll introduce the owner in his own words and celebrate the heritage and craft that make this a local business with a personal touch.</p></div><img loading="lazy" src="assets/beekeeper-owner.webp" alt="Concept beekeeper portrait"></div></section><section class="section-padding"><div class="container value-story"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">03 · THE EXPERIENCE</p><h2>More than<br><em>something sweet.</em></h2><p>From comb in honey to handmade beeswax candles, there is more to discover. We design the website so you can find a jar for your pantry or something special to share.</p><a class="btn btn-dark" href="shop.html">Explore the shop <span>↗</span></a></div><img loading="lazy" src="assets/market-candle-display.webp" alt="Real handmade beeswax candles at Flourish's market display"></div></section>'''
page('why-flourish.html','Why Flourish',why)
recipes='''<section class="page-hero recipe-hero"><div class="page-hero-copy container"><p class="eyebrow warm">SOMETHING FOR THE TABLE</p><h1>Made sweeter<br><em>with honey.</em></h1><p>Simple recipes and delicious little rituals for every jar in your pantry.</p></div><div class="page-hero-img"><img src="assets/pour.webp" alt="Honey being drizzled into a jar"></div></section><section class="section-padding"><div class="container"><div class="section-row"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">THE RECIPE JOURNAL</p><h2>Pass the honey.</h2></div><p class="section-desc">Three simple ideas to try at home. Recipe content is part of the initial creative proposal.</p></div><div class="recipe-card-grid"><article class="recipe-card"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/scene-honey.webp" alt="Honey and honeycomb still life"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">01 · BREAKFAST · 5 MIN</p><h3>Honey, Greek yogurt &amp; fresh berries</h3><p>A bowl of creamy yogurt, seasonal berries, toasted nuts and a generous spoonful of honey.</p><details><summary>See the simple recipe ↗</summary><ol><li>Spoon thick Greek yogurt into a bowl.</li><li>Top with berries and toasted nuts.</li><li>Finish with a drizzle of honey.</li></ol></details><a class="underlined-link" href="product.html?id=wildflower">Shop honey ↗</a></div></article><article class="recipe-card"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/scene-collection.webp" alt="Artisanal honey styled with golden beeswax goods"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">02 · DINNER · 20 MIN</p><h3>Golden honey-garlic glaze</h3><p>A quick blend of honey, garlic, lemon and soy sauce for roasted vegetables or cooked chicken.</p><details><summary>See the simple recipe ↗</summary><ol><li>Warm 2 tbsp honey with 1 tbsp soy sauce, lemon juice and minced garlic.</li><li>Simmer gently until lightly thickened.</li><li>Brush over cooked vegetables or chicken and serve.</li></ol></details><a class="underlined-link" href="shop.html">Find a jar ↗</a></div></article><article class="recipe-card"><img loading="lazy" src="assets/scene-gifts.webp" alt="Honey collection in a warm natural setting"><div><p class="eyebrow warm">03 · GATHERING · 10 MIN</p><h3>Honeycomb grazing board</h3><p>Soft cheese, toasted sourdough, pears, roasted nuts and a beautiful piece of honeycomb.</p><details><summary>See the simple recipe ↗</summary><ol><li>Arrange cheese and sliced fruit on a board.</li><li>Add crackers or toasted bread and nuts.</li><li>Place honeycomb at the center and enjoy.</li></ol></details><a class="underlined-link" href="product.html?id=honeycomb">Explore honeycomb ↗</a></div></article></div></div></section>'''
page('recipes.html','Recipes & Inspiration',recipes)
